_meanings:
The tenth and last incarnation of Viṣṇu in his capacity
 of the destroyer of the wicked and liberator of the world from its enemies;
 (Jayadeva, while referring to the several {%avatāras%} of Viṣṇu, thus
 refers to the last or {%Kalki%} avatāra:-- {#mlecCanivahaniDane kalayasi#}
 {#karavAlaM DUmaketumiva kimapi karAlam . keSavaDftakalkiSarIraM jaya jagadISa#}
 {#hare ..#} <ls>Gīt. 1. 10.</ls>)
